    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      49.44,
      844.93,
      564.82,
      897.84
    ],
    "text": "The wave height may increase about (2.0 \u2013 3.0) meters in the sea areas off the coast extending from Puttalam to Pottuvil via Colombo, Galle and Matara. There is a possibility of seawater inundation over the near shore areas extending from Chilaw to Matara via Colombo and Galle.",
    "fonts": [
